  "content": "<p>该模组的数据包版本请前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><p>为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>添加更多适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">超多生物群系</a>的切石机配方</p><ul>\n<li>所有木质材质的剥皮、去皮及回收利用</li>\n<li>从单格高花朵中获取更多染料</li>\n<li>玫瑰石英块可分解为玫瑰石英碎片</li>\n<li>（至1.19.2版本）泥砖可分解为泥砖块</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/rosequartzcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰石英切割\"></p><p>想要以单个模组的形式体验所有农夫乐事切割内容？请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事切割合集</a></p>",
